<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cone of Shards</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 32, up to 80%)
Also taught by: Iko the ogre mage, in his cave by the troll town of Galgachus (Sorcerers only, from level 65, up to 30%)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast cone of shards &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast cone of shards</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>Summons a cone of sharp shards that tears into the target. The better your 
magic and your skill in the spell, the harder it strikes. It hurts most 
through clothes and least through plate, which takes about a quarter less, 
and a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Energy Bolt</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clenched Fist</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summoning Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>